   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Cinematic red-teal: median ~71, deep blacks (p1 ~4), magenta-tinted shadows (32,20,26), neutral-warm highlights (216,210,208), red 32% against aqua 20% + magenta 11%, saturation 0.42. Best for: Telephoto street compression, red umbrellas and jackets, rain and fog, moody evening city, cinematic couple walks. Film-poster colour.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
